nked (GlcNAc...) asparagine"},{"type":"Transmembrane","start":214,"end":234,"description":"Helical"},{"type":"Topological domain","start":235,"end":685,"description":"Cytoplasmic"},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":248,"end":442,"description":""},{"type":"Modified residue","start":257,"end":257,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Region","start":344,"end":442,"description":"SOAR/CAD"},{"type":"Region","start":475,"end":483,"description":"Contributes to fast Ca(2+)-dependent inactivation of CRAC channels"},{"type":"Site","start":496,"end":496,"description":"(Microbial infection) Cleavage; by SARS-CoV-2 3C-like proteinase nsp5"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":504,"end":504,"description":"Phosphothreonine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":512,"end":512,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":517,"end":517,"description":"Phosphothreonine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":519,"end":519,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":521,"end":521,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":523,"end":523,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":524,"end":524,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":567,"end":567,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":575,"end":575,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":602,"end":602,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":608,"end":608,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":618,"end":618,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":621,"end":621,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":628,"end":628,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Motif","start":642,"end":645,"description":"Microtubule tip localization signal"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":660,"end":660,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":665,"end":665,"description":"Phosphothreonine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":668,"end":668,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Region","start":672,"end":685,"description":"Required for generation of inwardly rectifying CRAC currents"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Monomer in the presence of Ca(2+); it oligomerizes in absence of Ca(2+) (PubMed:18854159). Forms homooligomers and heterooligomers with STIM2 (PubMed:11463338, PubMed:11983428, PubMed:18854159, PubMed:22451904, PubMed:24069340, PubMed:24351972). Interacts with pore-forming subunits of CRAC channels, ORAI1, ORAI2 and ORAI3; this interaction is potentiated upon Ca(2+) store depletion (PubMed:19706554, PubMed:32415068). Interacts (via the transmembrane region and the SOAR/CAD domain) with SPPL3; the interaction promotes the binding of STIM1 to ORAI1 (PubMed:25384971). Interacts (via the SOAR/CAD domain) with ORAI1 (PubMed:17905723, PubMed:19182790, PubMed:19249086, PubMed:24351972, PubMed:27185316, PubMed:28219928, PubMed:30481768). Interacts with MAPRE1; probably required for targeting to the growing microtubule plus ends (PubMed:19632184). Interacts with CRACR2A/EFCAB4B; the interaction is direct and takes place in absence of Ca(2+) (PubMed:20418871). Forms a complex with CRACR2A/EFCAB4B and ORAI1 at low concentration of Ca(2+), the complex dissociates at elevated Ca(2+) concentrations (PubMed:20418871). Interacts with SARAF, promoting a slow inactivation of STIM1-dependent SOCE activity, possibly by facilitating the deoligomerization of STIM1 (PubMed:22464749, PubMed:30481768). Interacts with EFHB; the interaction takes place upon Ca(2+)-store depletion and inhibits the association with SARAF (PubMed:30481768). Interacts with ASPH (isoform 8) (PubMed:22586105). Interacts with SLC35G1; intracellular Ca(2+)-dependent. May interact with ATP1A1, ATP2A2, ATP2B1, ATP2B4, KPNB1 and XPO1; through SLC35G1 (PubMed:22084111). Interacts with TMEM203 (PubMed:25996873). Interacts with STIMATE, promoting STIM1 conformational switch (PubMed:26322679). Interacts with TMEM178A (By similarity). Interacts with CASQ1 (via C-terminal end and preferentially with the monomeric form); this interaction increases in response to a depletion of intracellular Ca(2+), decreases both STIM1 aggregation and clustering, interaction of STIM1 with ORAI1 and store-operated Ca(2+) entry (SOCE) activity (PubMed:27185316). Interacts with ADCY8 (PubMed:22494970). Interacts with STING1; this interaction retains STING1 in the endoplasmic reticulum membrane (PubMed:30643259)"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with vaccinia virus protein OPG147; this interaction inhibits dissociation of STING1 from STIM1 following cGAMP stimulation"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q13586-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":540,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000527651.5"],"refseq":["NM_001277962.2"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001264891.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,514]],"edits":[{"start":515,"end":685,"original":"DLTHSDSESSLHMSDRQRVAPKPPQMSRAADEALNAMTSN","replacement":"GSSLKANRLSSKGFDPFRFGVLPPHE","added":26}],"missing":171,"replaced":0,"novel":26,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[[13,171,0],[21,1,0],[22,1,0],[23,1,0],[24,1,0],[25,1,0],[26,1,0],[27,1,0],[28,1,0],[29,1,0],[30,1,0],[31,1,0],[32,1,0],[33,4,0],[34,1,0],[35,1,0],[36,1,0],[37,14,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q13586-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q13586-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":72.6,"plddt":[[50,2],[70,11],[50,4],[0,22],[50,3],[70,22],[90,9],[70,2],[90,1],[70,1],[90,1],[70,3],[90,3],[70,2],[90,1],[70,28],[90,6],[70,2],[90,2],[70,3],[90,13],[70,12],[90,2],[70,8],[90,2],[70,5],[50,9],[70,1],[50,2],[70,11],[90,2],[70,7],[50,3],[0,3],[50,2],[70,1],[50,1],[70,8],[90,6],[70,1],[90,2],[70,7],[50,1],[70,2],[50,2],[70,2],[50,2],[70,2],[50,1],[70,2],[50,1],[70,10],[50,1],[70,2],[50,2],[70,1],[50,12],[70,2],[50,1],[70,14],[50,1],[70,2],[50,13],[70,1],[50,1],[70